## The typed relation graph

Open [graph.html](graph.html) to browse it.
Records cluster by domain, selecting one renders it beside the graph, and a link inside a record navigates to it.
The page is self-contained, so it opens from the filesystem with no server.

Every edge below is derived from the record it appears in.
This view therefore cannot drift from the records the way the hand-maintained table it replaced did.
The same edge set is [graph.md](graph.md) and, as raw data, [graph.json](graph.json).

